(indistinct), like
choosing how to choose if,

00:06:26.142 --> 00:06:29.130
I mean all these debate choice if

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.840
system should be choosing itself, right?

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:34.341
So would the not choose that
as would be like some sort

00:06:34.341 --> 00:06:37.170
(indistinct) of be self-selective?

