00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.200
would you want to,

00:06:42.184 --> 00:06:44.610
would this to examine lotteries
as an intermediate step?

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.280
So not like directly going
to selection of congress,

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.660
but selecting the committees

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.457
or the select right, that goes back

00:06:51.457 --> 00:06:54.149
to selecting the juries, right?

