00:35:14.760 --> 00:35:16.470
and they like to dominate the conversation

00:35:16.470 --> 00:35:17.640
and they're skilled, right?

00:35:17.640 --> 00:35:18.750
If you think about juries, right?

00:35:18.750 --> 00:35:21.123
You know, some folks are, you know,

00:35:21.990 --> 00:35:24.900
professors are maybe often
we're on fewer juries

00:35:24.900 --> 00:35:27.480
because is our job to convince
people that we're right.

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:31.620
And maybe that would not be
great in like a, a jury system.

00:35:31.620 --> 00:35:34.143
But yeah. Great questions
